      <title>Josh Downs' first day as a Chief: he'll wear No. 12, and KC waived returner Nikko Remigio and rookie DE Jack Pyburn to clear room</title>
      <link>https://www.kmbc.com/article/chiefs-josh-downs-trade-mahomes-reid-falcons/74395590</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.kmbc.com/article/chiefs-josh-downs-trade-mahomes-reid-falcons/74395590</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:56:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://kubrick.htvapps.com/htv-prod/images/02b19507-43fb-431f-af2c-efc657828061.jpg?crop=1.00xw:0.846xh;0,0.0439xh&amp;resize=1200:*" alt="Josh Downs meets the Kansas City media" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Downs called it a blessing to play alongside Mahomes and said he'd heard Reid is a 'great mastermind of offense.' On the number: he wore 1 and then 2, so the equipment manager told him to put them together.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;It's good when guys welcome you and accept you. I feel like at this point it's my turn to earn their respect on the field, and earn their respect as a teammate. I'm going to do what I can to do that.&rdquo; - <a href="https://heavy.com/sports/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs/josh-downs-connection-with-rashee-rice/">Josh Downs, Chiefs WR</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.kmbc.com/article/chiefs-josh-downs-trade-mahomes-reid-falcons/74395590">KMBC</a> &middot; <a href="https://apnews.com/article/chiefs-downs-receptor-mahomes-canje-colts-nfl-94762c1b8edd98b805e0515e1fba2d95">AP</a></p>
