    <item>
      <title>The chemistry head start: Rashee Rice says he and Downs have trained together every offseason since before the draft</title>
      <link>https://heavy.com/sports/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs/josh-downs-connection-with-rashee-rice/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://heavy.com/sports/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs/josh-downs-connection-with-rashee-rice/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:35:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://heavy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/kansas-city-chiefs-practice-media-availability-kansas-city-missouri-november-e1794425966638.jpg?quality=65&amp;strip=all" alt="Josh Downs in his No. 12 Chiefs jersey at the podium" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Rice texted Downs eye emojis the night of the trade; the two share a locker-room area and have been walking through the playbook together. Downs called Rice 'my dog' and said the relationship factored into wanting KC.</b></p>
