    <item>
      <title>Antigravity is rolling out browser use: agents can now run and verify the code they write in a live browser, with auth and downloads gated on your approval</title>
      <link>https://antigravity.google/docs/browser/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://antigravity.google/docs/browser/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 05:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>AI &amp; Agents</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://antigravity.google/og/docs/browser.png" alt="Google Antigravity browser use documentation" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>The /browser command closes the research-code-verify loop - playtest a checkout flow, check a mobile viewport, report console errors. Users control authentication, downloads pause for approval, and agents can run multiple browser tasks in parallel.</b></p>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://antigravity.google/docs/browser/">Google Antigravity Docs</a> &middot; <a href="https://ai.tldr.tech/p/2026-11-12-tldr-ai">TLDR AI</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20loved%20%22Antigravity%20is%20rolling%20out%20browser%20use%3A...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Antigravity%20is%20rolling%20out%20browser%20use%3A...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20less%20like%20%22Antigravity%20is%20rolling%20out%20browser%20use%3A...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//antigravity.google/docs/browser/%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
