    <item>
      <title>OpenRouter measured what tool surfaces cost in context: same GitHub task took 59,417 input tokens via MCP, 3,315 via a skill, 1,421 via the gh CLI</title>
      <link>https://openrouter.ai/blog/insights/mcp-vs-cli-vs-skills/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://openrouter.ai/blog/insights/mcp-vs-cli-vs-skills/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>AI &amp; Agents</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://openrouter.ai/blog/images/mcp-vs-cli-vs-skills.png" alt="OpenRouter post card: MCP vs CLI vs Skills token costs" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>The GitHub MCP server's 46 default tool definitions alone add 19,436 tokens to every request on Sonnet 5.5, and one release-object result cost ~20,400 more. Tool Search cut the up-front cost under 600 tokens - halving the total on Sonnet 5.5, though it raised costs on Haiku 5.5.</b></p>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://openrouter.ai/blog/insights/mcp-vs-cli-vs-skills/">OpenRouter</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20loved%20%22OpenRouter%20measured%20what%20tool%20surfaces...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20meh%20on%20%22OpenRouter%20measured%20what%20tool%20surfaces...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20less%20like%20%22OpenRouter%20measured%20what%20tool%20surfaces...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//openrouter.ai/blog/insights/mcp-vs-cli-vs-skills/%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
      <media:content url="https://openrouter.ai/blog/images/mcp-vs-cli-vs-skills.png" medium="image"/>
    </item>
