      <title>SF weighs bringing back the 90-day shelter-stay cap, ending the unlimited stays that began in the pandemic - 383 people are on the wait list</title>
      <link>https://www.sfexaminer.com/news/the-city/90-day-shelter-cap-proposal-receives-public-feedback/article_9116b88f-5cdd-4fb5-9b07-5a968cad5496.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.sfexaminer.com/news/the-city/90-day-shelter-cap-proposal-receives-public-feedback/article_9116b88f-5cdd-4fb5-9b07-5a968cad5496.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 05:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>San Francisco</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bloximages.chicago2.vip.townnews.com/sfexaminer.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/b/e9/be9ad20f-c50e-42b8-bac1-4c68f7d88f8e/68a8b28b92e50.image.jpg?crop=1763,926,0,124&amp;resize=1200,630&amp;order=crop,resize" alt="The Eleanora Fagan Center shelter" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Public comment closed Monday; the policy would take effect in March. Advocates worry extension rules put the burden on residents with uneven case-manager access - one client spent three days on the street mid-appeal and lost his documents. The city had 4,844 shelter beds at 91% occupancy at the end of 2025.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Shelter should be more than a safe place to sleep - it should be a pathway to stability and housing.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.sfexaminer.com/news/the-city/90-day-shelter-cap-proposal-receives-public-feedback/article_9116b88f-5cdd-4fb5-9b07-5a968cad5496.html">Dept. of Homelessness and Supportive Housing statement</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.sfexaminer.com/news/the-city/90-day-shelter-cap-proposal-receives-public-feedback/article_9116b88f-5cdd-4fb5-9b07-5a968cad5496.html">SF Examiner</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20loved%20%22SF%20weighs%20bringing%20back%20the%2090-day%20shel...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20meh%20on%20%22SF%20weighs%20bringing%20back%20the%2090-day%20shel...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/12%3A%20less%20like%20%22SF%20weighs%20bringing%20back%20the%2090-day%20shel...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.sfexaminer.com/news/the-city/90-day-shelter-cap-proposal-receives-public-feedback/article_9116b88f-5cdd-4fb5-9b07-5a968cad5496.html%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
